Observation-only ISO OUT ring accounting: count guest packets/bytes a ring
accepts or refuses (out of buffers), and at ring release trace those totals
with the guest packets still waiting in the copy queue, which are discarded
(usb_host_iso_ring_free). No transport or timing behaviour change intended.
Apply AFTER qemu-iso.patch, qemu-poll.patch, qemu-wait.patch and
qemu-orphan.patch to QEMU v11.1.0 commit 84f07211cc5b4fc6a371559bf8a5de4fb068e648.
The emulator as a whole remains GPL-2.0-or-later. host-libusb.c keeps its
original upstream notice:
